// erhai: keep the GJS OSK split-keyboard halves flush with both screen edges.
//
// oneplus-erhai-desktop upgrades replace gjsosk's extension.js, which drops
// the one-line spacer fix.  This re-applies it after every dpkg run; the
// helper is a no-op while the fix is in place and only warns if upstream
// changes that line.  Remove with 'sudo gjsosk-split-flush uninstall'.
DPkg::Post-Invoke { "[ ! -x /usr/local/sbin/gjsosk-split-flush ] || /usr/local/sbin/gjsosk-split-flush reapply || true"; };
